ipping naming nits.\n\n### Things I checked that were fine\n\n- Per-turn `checkpoint/temporary.go` writes (lines 379, 450, 456) correctly retain plain `redact.JSONLBytes`/`redact.Bytes` with a clear comment explaining the data-flow boundary.\n- `*WithPrivacyFilter` API design: `ctx context.Context` first across all four new entry points; plain entry points unchanged; callers in `committed.go`, `v2_committed.go`, `manual_commit_condensation.go`, `manual_commit_hooks.go` all migrated and threaded ctx through.\n- `cmd.WaitDelay = 500 * time.Millisecond` in `shellout.go:133` is well-documented and `TestShellOut_Timeout` asserts the elapsed-time bound (`> 3s`) that the WaitDelay protects against.\n- Char→byte conversion in `RedactBatch` is correctly tested with multi-byte UTF-8 (`TestShellOut_RedactBatch_MultiByteUTF8Offsets`).\n- Batching in `JSONLContentWithPrivacyFilter` runs OPF once per condensation with dedup; `TestJSONLBytesWithPrivacyFilter_BatchesOPFCalls` locks that in.\n- `mergeOPFSettings` merges categories key-by-key (override wins) and preserves base `Enabled` when override omits it; settings tests cover this.\n- Refactor of `EnsureRedactionConfigured` body into `loadAndApplyRedactionSettings` is behavior-preserving and unblocks direct testability (covered by `redaction_wireup_test.go`).\n- `formatOPFFailure` covers both synthetic sentinels and real production errors (`exec.ErrNotFound`, `os.ErrNotExist`, wrapped `context.DeadlineExceeded`)."}],"totalDurationMs":262284,"totalTokens":169987,"totalToolUseCount":40,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":166519,"output_tokens":3110,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":357},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3110,"cache_read_input_tokens":166519,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_creation":{"ephemer