ret in the JSONL, and verifies (a) no error escapes,\n   (b) the secret IS redacted (proving regex/entropy layers ran), (c)\n   no [REDACTED_PERSON] applied, and (d) the runtime WAS invoked once.\n\n4. (Important) Has-space gate in JSONLContentWithPrivacyFilter's pass-1\n   collector was only loosely asserted. Extended\n   TestJSONLBytesWithPrivacyFilter_BatchesOPFCalls to walk\n   fake.lastInputs and assert NO non-prose input reaches OPF — without\n   this, removing the gate would silently regress to multi-minute\n   commits and existing tests wouldn't catch it.\n\n5. (Important) RedactBatch's return-length contract was implicit; a\n   future daemon-mode runtime returning len(batched) < len(inputs)\n   would panic with index-out-of-range. JSONLContentWithPrivacyFilter\n   now bounds-checks the loop and slog.Warns on mismatch. Added\n   TestJSONLBytesWithPrivacyFilter_GracefulOnShortBatch with a fake\n   that returns a single slice for three inputs and a defer/recover\n   asserting no panic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git push origin feat/openai-privacy-filter 2>&1 | tail -5","description":"Commit + push fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":443,"cache_read_input_tokens":964466,"output_tokens":1220,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":443,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1220,"cache_read_input_tokens":964466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":443,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":443},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cb2xfL3SJjcbr6yjvntQ5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ced504e7-2063-4b75-802b-40e027d36958","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:48:26.021Z","us